{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09585","headline":"巩北秋兴寄崔明允 · 岑参","name":"巩北秋兴寄崔明允","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白露披梧桐，玄蝉昼夜号。\n秋风万里动，日暮黄云高。\n君子佐休明，小人事蓬蒿。\n所适在鱼鸟，焉能徇锥刀。\n孤舟向广武，一鸟归成臯。\n胜概日相与，思君心郁陶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}